            <ArticleTitle>The evaluation of chronic wrist pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>183-92</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Guidelines for the assessment of the chronically painful wrist are described, including the uses and limitations of plain roentgenograms, arthrography, CT, tomography, and cineradiography. A careful review of these studies is emphasized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
